  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4002901",
      "subQuestName": "Head for Albedo's campsite",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400290101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400290101": {
            "id": "400290101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Albedo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290102"
            ]
          },
          "400290102": {
            "id": "400290102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Traveler, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290103"
            ]
          },
          "400290103": {
            "id": "400290103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I suppose your story is ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290104"
            ]
          },
          "400290104": {
            "id": "400290104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup yup! How about you? Do you need some more time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290105"
            ]
          },
          "400290105": {
            "id": "400290105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "No need. I am also ready to tell my story.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290106"
            ]
          },
          "400290106": {
            "id": "400290106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon calls dibs! Paimon first!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290107"
            ]
          },
          "400290107": {
            "id": "400290107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Please, go ahead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290108"
            ]
          },
          "400290108": {
            "id": "400290108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, here goes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290109"
            ]
          },
          "400290109": {
            "id": "400290109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Once upon a time, there was an evil researcher who went into the mountains and did a crazy experiment on whopperflowers to transform their appearance. After a lot of pain and suffering, the whopperflowers finally took on a human form. Then, they stood by the side of the mountain to wait for unsuspecting bypassers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290110"
            ]
          },
          "400290110": {
            "id": "400290110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "To whoever spoke to them, they would ask some questions, such as: \"Who am I?\" \"Who are you?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290111"
            ]
          },
          "400290111": {
            "id": "400290111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If the bypasser got the wrong answer... The last sound they'd make would be a \"yelp\" before the whopperflower ate them alive in one bite!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290112"
            ]
          },
          "400290112": {
            "id": "400290112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Oh, truly frightening.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290113"
            ]
          },
          "400290113": {
            "id": "400290113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes, Paimon is truly frightening.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290114"
            ]
          },
          "400290114": {
            "id": "400290114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What the... You two aren't scared at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290115"
            ]
          },
          "400290115": {
            "id": "400290115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe I'm just really tough, I don't know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290116"
            ]
          },
          "400290116": {
            "id": "400290116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't go nitpicking, okay! If you didn't like the story, go write your own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290117"
            ]
          },
          "400290117": {
            "id": "400290117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ooh, in that case, I would add some horror elements in...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290120"
            ]
          },
          "400290120": {
            "id": "400290120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "In other words, the whopperflowers would ambush and then completely replace their victims.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290121"
            ]
          },
          "400290121": {
            "id": "400290121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And then adopt their newfound identity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290122"
            ]
          },
          "400290122": {
            "id": "400290122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And then what? Go back to where the person lives? Enter their home!? Eat their whole family!? Aaaah!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290123"
            ]
          },
          "400290123": {
            "id": "400290123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, Paimon made up this story, but now Paimon's the one who's scared by it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290124"
            ]
          },
          "400290124": {
            "id": "400290124",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "It's a good story. May I write it down? I may bring it up in future conversations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290125"
            ]
          },
          "400290125": {
            "id": "400290125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What for? Just to scare people with?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290126"
            ]
          },
          "400290126": {
            "id": "400290126",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290127"
            ]
          },
          "400290127": {
            "id": "400290127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You've got a real mean streak, Albedo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290128"
            ]
          },
          "400290128": {
            "id": "400290128",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So what's your story?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290129"
            ]
          },
          "400290129": {
            "id": "400290129",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Mine is a little longer than yours. It starts with an alchemist.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290130"
            ]
          },
          "400290130": {
            "id": "400290130",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "A great alchemist once created Subject One. Subject One was her proudest achievement, and successfully blended into human society. No one ever would have thought that this friend of theirs was in fact a synthetic human.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290131"
            ]
          },
          "400290131": {
            "id": "400290131",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "However, unbeknownst to Subject One, the alchemist had tried the same experiment many times before he had come into being. Some of the rejects from failed experiments had been discarded, but had not died.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290132"
            ]
          },
          "400290132": {
            "id": "400290132",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Subject Two was one such failed experiment. He was swallowed by a great dragon that came to rest upon a snowswept mountain. Many years later, he was resurrected by the dragon's mysterious power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290133"
            ]
          },
          "400290133": {
            "id": "400290133",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "He saw all kinds of people on the mountain, including... Subject One, who had somehow, miraculously, blended in among them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290134"
            ]
          },
          "400290134": {
            "id": "400290134",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Never in Subject Two's wildest imagination had he thought it possible for experimental life forms such as they to deceive everyone so successfully. He saw the way humans accepted Subject One as a friend, witnessed their affection as they addressed him by name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290135"
            ]
          },
          "400290135": {
            "id": "400290135",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "This was what Subject Two wanted. Now, all that Subject Two desired was to replace Subject One and take the joy of his existence for himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290136"
            ]
          },
          "400290136": {
            "id": "400290136",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhhh... Th—This is giving Paimon the chills. It's so scary...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290137"
            ]
          },
          "400290137": {
            "id": "400290137",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Subject Two began to unfold his plan. He stole Subject One's books and notes and studied all that Subject One had learned from the alchemist. Subject Two was highly intelligent and he learned quickly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290138"
            ]
          },
          "400290138": {
            "id": "400290138",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "He changed his face into an exact replica of Subject One's face. Then, he found a plant with mimicry capabilities and transformed it using dragon blood and alchemy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290139"
            ]
          },
          "400290139": {
            "id": "400290139",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290140"
            ]
          },
          "400290140": {
            "id": "400290140",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "And so, not only did Subject Two transform his own appearance to perfectly match that of Subject One, he also created a third entity: Subject Three.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290141"
            ]
          },
          "400290141": {
            "id": "400290141",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What!? There's three of them now!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290142"
            ]
          },
          "400290142": {
            "id": "400290142",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "But Subject Two wanted to become a perfected human. So, he erased the mark on both his and Subject Three's necks, for these marks were symbols of imperfection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290143"
            ]
          },
          "400290143": {
            "id": "400290143",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He purposely erased it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290144"
            ]
          },
          "400290144": {
            "id": "400290144",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "In my view, it was probably a subconscious act. An instinct.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290145"
            ]
          },
          "400290145": {
            "id": "400290145",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "He so desperately craved to become a perfect human being that he forgot something: Human beings are defined by their flaws.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290146"
            ]
          },
          "400290146": {
            "id": "400290146",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Subject Two's plan was meticulously crafted. Subject Three would draw Subject One's attention. After Subject One disposed of Subject Three, he would assume the threat had now disappeared, and would let his guard down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290147"
            ]
          },
          "400290147": {
            "id": "400290147",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "The next moment that Subject One was alone, Subject Two would make his move. He would eliminate Subject One and become the only one remaining.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290148"
            ]
          },
          "400290148": {
            "id": "400290148",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "He would secretly replace the Subject One of everyone's memories, and inherit his identity, residence, clothing, sword, name, and friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290149"
            ]
          },
          "400290149": {
            "id": "400290149",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "People would have no idea that the individual they knew had become somebody else from one day to the next.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290150"
            ]
          },
          "400290150": {
            "id": "400290150",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh, uhh, this is way too scary... Paimon's never gonna be able to trust anyone again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290151"
            ]
          },
          "400290151": {
            "id": "400290151",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "But just before Subject Two could carry out his plan, a unique stranger entered the mix. Subject Two tried to make contact with this person, but found that they could somehow sense he was different from Subject One.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290152"
            ]
          },
          "400290152": {
            "id": "400290152",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290153"
            ]
          },
          "400290153": {
            "id": "400290153",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290154"
            ]
          },
          "400290154": {
            "id": "400290154",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "What's wrong? Are you scared?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290155"
            ]
          },
          "400290155": {
            "id": "400290155",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What happened then? What happened to the stranger?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290156"
            ]
          },
          "400290156": {
            "id": "400290156",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "He became a new stage in Subject Two's plan. One more person that Subject Two had to dispose of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290157"
            ]
          },
          "400290157": {
            "id": "400290157",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "It's as if there were three identical roses in a garden. Only one of the three was a fine specimen, while the other two were defective specimens that bore poisonous thorns.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290158"
            ]
          },
          "400290158": {
            "id": "400290158",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "In all the world, only the gardener who tended to them could tell which was the good specimen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290159"
            ]
          },
          "400290159": {
            "id": "400290159",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "People do not like poisonous plants. Only a perfect rose can fetch a high price. If the inferior specimens wanted to conceal the fact of their worthlessness, they would have to take the gardener out of the picture using their poisonous thorns.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290160"
            ]
          },
          "400290160": {
            "id": "400290160",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "This is exactly what Subject Two was thinking. So he hid in the shadows and waited patiently. Maybe soon, he would get his chance to become truly human.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290161"
            ]
          },
          "400290161": {
            "id": "400290161",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(This is not just a story...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290162"
            ]
          },
          "400290162": {
            "id": "400290162",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(These are real events. Albedo is trying to tell me the cruel and unbelievable truth.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290163"
            ]
          },
          "400290163": {
            "id": "400290163",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whew, that was intense. So what happened after that? Did Subject Two's plan succeed? Uhh, Paimon can't bear thinking about it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290164"
            ]
          },
          "400290164": {
            "id": "400290164",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Fortunately, it is just a story, and even in this story, Subject Two did not succeed. But you can never let your guard down on Dragonspine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290165"
            ]
          },
          "400290165": {
            "id": "400290165",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Monsters mutated with Durin's power and blood are also creatures of Rhinedottir, just like me. You must beware of all such creatures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290166"
            ]
          },
          "400290166": {
            "id": "400290166",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't say that! You're not a monster, you're my friend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290167"
            ]
          },
          "400290167": {
            "id": "400290167",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I'm glad to hear that. It's okay. I know what I am. You and I are both \"different,\" so there is no need for me to hide the truth from you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290168"
            ]
          },
          "400290168": {
            "id": "400290168",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "The only thing is that sometimes, when I think about how mighty the power of alchemy is, I feel so small.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290169"
            ]
          },
          "400290169": {
            "id": "400290169",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "As beings who set foot in this world, how arrogant are we in desiring to control our destiny, and in desiring to create?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290170"
            ]
          },
          "400290170": {
            "id": "400290170",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Is creation an arrogant act, Traveler? If not, why do we call the ones that created us and control us, \"gods\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290171"
            ]
          },
          "400290171": {
            "id": "400290171",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "If it is, then what qualifies us to call ourselves creators? How far must we take our reverence and respect, and what purpose does it serve?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290172"
            ]
          },
          "400290172": {
            "id": "400290172",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did you feel when you took out the impostor?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290173"
            ]
          },
          "400290173": {
            "id": "400290173",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Nothing special. But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290174"
            ]
          },
          "400290174": {
            "id": "400290174",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "...Whenever I think about it, I feel a twinge of grief.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290175"
            ]
          },
          "400290175": {
            "id": "400290175",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Poor Albedo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290176"
            ]
          },
          "400290176": {
            "id": "400290176",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Helloooo! Traveler! Are you here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290177"
            ]
          },
          "400290177": {
            "id": "400290177",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, is that Amber?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290178"
            ]
          },
          "400290178": {
            "id": "400290178",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Thought we might find you here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290179"
            ]
          },
          "400290179": {
            "id": "400290179",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "We're here to deliver a message from Cyrus. There's gonna be a big event down at the base camp, and they want you there too, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290180"
            ]
          },
          "400290180": {
            "id": "400290180",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Winter camp is nearing its end. Apparently, even provisional instructors are required to attend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290181"
            ]
          },
          "400290181": {
            "id": "400290181",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like we need to go, Albedo. Bye for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290182"
            ]
          },
          "400290182": {
            "id": "400290182",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Then I won't keep you. I have some things to attend to here, so forgive me for not seeing you down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290183"
            ]
          },
          "400290183": {
            "id": "400290183",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Don't worry about it! There've been no issues getting up and down the mountain recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400290184"
            ]
          },
          "400290184": {
            "id": "400290184",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Is everyone ready? Let's not keep them waiting."
          }
        }
      }
